# Agent routing

**Canonical kernel:** [`docs/agents-routing.md`](../../docs/agents-routing.md)  
**Profile:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) · **Playbook:** [`docs/agents-playbook.md`](../../docs/agents-playbook.md) · **Master:** [`docs/agents-master.md`](../../docs/agents-master.md)

## Every task (do not skip)

1. Resolve repository → workspace → environment → technology → active module (`agents-routing.md` §4–§7).  
2. Load AI instructions in kernel order (§0 / §9).  
3. Classify task (§8) → run decision pipeline (§2).  
4. Touch **only** affected modules; never guess repo / framework / env.  
5. Finish with completion gate (§12).

Conflict priority: user → platform/session mandate → routing kernel → playbook/rules → `AGENTS.md` → master → conventions.

